Establish `h2 : compAt W.θ τ (mt (G.V (.grid D.R.m D.R.m)) ((kappa W g).2 (Fin.last D.R.m))) = W.onb (.grid D.R.m D.R.m) τ * (g.2 (Fin.last D.R.m) τ).1.submatrix (Fin.cast (rank_gridM G (i` using `D.R.m) le_rfl)) (Fin.cast (rank_gridM G (i := D.R.m) le_rfl)) * (W.onb (.grid D.R.m D.R.m) τ)⁻¹ := compAt_kappa_snd g (Fin.last D.R.m) hPg τ`. Establish `hA` using `mul_adaptedFrame_of_blocks (c := (rowSizes D).nC D.R.m) _ _ _ _ _ ((g.2 (Fin.last D.R.m) τ).1 : Matrix (Fin ((rowSizes D).nC D.R.m)) (Fin ((rowSizes D).nC D.R.m)) ℂ) (rank_gridM G (i := D.R.m) le_rfl) (rowSizes D).nC_succ (rank_top G (j := D.R.m) le_rfl) hdO h1 h2 h3`. Establish `key : (topFrame W τ)⁻¹ * compAt W.θ τ (mt _ (kappaTop W g)) * topFrame W τ = (embed (rowSizes D).nC_succ (g.2 (Fin.last D.R.m)) τ).1.submatrix (Fin.cast (rank_top G (j` using `D.R.m) le_rfl)) (Fin.cast (rank_top G (j := D.R.m) le_rfl)) := by`. Establish `hA' : compAt W.θ τ (mt _ (kappaTop W g)) * topFrame W τ = topFrame W τ * (embed (rowSizes D).nC_succ (g.2 (Fin.last D.R.m)) τ).1.submatrix (Fin.cast (rank_top G (j` using `D.R.m) le_rfl)) (Fin.cast (rank_top G (j := D.R.m) le_rfl)) := hA`. Rewrite using `[Matrix.mul_assoc, hA', ← Matrix.mul_assoc, Matrix.nonsing_inv_mul _ hdT, Matrix.one_mul]`.

